{"title":"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Sandy’s Fruit Market sells cherries, plums and blueberries. For each type of fruit, the price of one box is shown in the table.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On Wednesday, Shane bought 2 boxes of plums. He bought some boxes of cherries, no blueberries, and spent $22.00 in total. How many boxes of cherries did he buy?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of boxes of cherries that Shane bought. \n</p><p>From the table, we can see that each box of cherries costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/3/bc3719c11bac960e400f5099762d5e39f6476d92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> and each box of plums costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a7d7975b71234a1a73891e9cb9743311cf33e03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />. Since he spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/0/1e0f8ecd05d8670f4fd77a632513ea0ef919cc8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$22.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" /> in total, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a810484db2a39853e97c0ed0ee68090022c454.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2c  + 3 \\times 2 = 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"124\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/a/aca5b1186c94156ca182b8b0c7a4f9a25a58f197.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2c + 6 = 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027bafaf8c7ef389823489ced9f61dedd2d86f14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2c = 22 - 6 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23f222b30a27ee7db8eaaa90efaa86024d87c9e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\frac{16}{2} = \\boxed{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"101\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018005258\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 45/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: